dle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Polk County runs 75 years, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that pair finished at 61% of normal. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 51% and February to March at 58%. Grid 17543 had its driest year in 1963 at 53%.</p>"}
